## Build

```
make build      # native binary + ui/dist, for `nanite plugin install ./`
make release    # full cross-platform archives under dist/archives/
```

## Install from source

```
nanite plugin install ./ --link
```

`--link` symlinks the source directory into `$NANITE_PLUGINS_DIR` so iterative
rebuilds (`make build`) take effect on the next plugin reload.

## Layout

- `main.go` — subprocess entrypoint (speaks JSON-RPC over stdio via plugin-sdk v0.6.0).
- `plugin.yaml` — generated schema-v2 JSON (valid YAML), declaring the `{{.Name}}` command and shared `echo` tool.
- `./{{.Name}} --manifest` — emits the declaration from `main.go`; regenerate `plugin.yaml` after changing it.
- `ui/src/index.tsx` — React envelope components, bundled into `ui/dist/index.js`.
- `envelopes/` — JSON Schemas for emitted envelopes.
